 "narrative":{"northStar":"The material library","overview":"An operational specimen library: quiet porcelain fields let real Microsoft artwork carry the color, with a deep blue-green navigation rail to establish orientation. Standard web controls remain familiar. The selected collection is the one expressive movement, arriving as a compact tray without moving or altering the specimens.","keyCharacteristics":["Clear work areas and compact humanist typography.","Untouched specimens with full-name labels.","Mint selection, no ornamental illustration."],"rules":[{"name":"The Source Fidelity Rule","body":"UI theming never recolors, crops or transforms icon artwork.","section":"colors"}],"dos":["Do keep service names readable and complete.","Do preserve source artwork and aspect ratios.","Do keep keyboard focus distinct in both themes."],"donts":["Don't use Microsoft artwork as the application's brand.","Don't add decorative charts, gradients or fabricated usage claims.","Don't hide core actions behind hover on touch devices."]}
